  "title": "Small Batch Leftover Stuffing Muffins",
  "description": "Use leftover stuffing from Thanksgiving to make these easy muffins. This recipe only makes 4 muffins, but depending on how much stuffing you have left over, feel free to scale up.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
